- Cursor-less Allocation: Implements FIFO layer matching via window functions (SUM OVER ORDER BY) for sub-millisecond throughput.
- Concurrency Protection: Employs UPDLOCK and ROWLOCK hints to prevent race conditions during high-volume order picking.
- Strongly Typed Orchestration: Coordinates database stored procedure calls with explicit decimal precision/scale parameter mappings.

