### Key Architectural Highlights:
- **Zero-Allocation Streaming Bulk Copy**: Custom `DbDataReader` implementation streams C# in-memory collections directly to `SqlBulkCopy` without constructing intermediate `DataTable` objects, eliminating GC heap fragmentation.
- **High-Volume PAGE Compression**: Table definitions leverage SQL Server `PAGE` compression to achieve 4x–8x storage reduction on high-cardinality time-series data streams.
- **Two-Phase Staging & Merge Pattern**: Ingests high-velocity batches into staging buffers before executing set-based deduplicating merges into the permanent partitioned tables.

